1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,120
When you drink coffee matters more than how much.

2
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:09,854
Caffeine stays in your body for hours. About half can still be there five hours later.

3
00:00:11,204 --> 00:00:16,011
So if you sleep at ten, try to have your last coffee by around two in the afternoon.

4
00:00:17,361 --> 00:00:21,869
Watch out for hidden caffeine in tea, soda, energy drinks, and chocolate.

5
00:00:23,119 --> 00:00:26,949
For most healthy adults, about four cups a day is the upper limit.

6
00:00:28,199 --> 00:00:33,209
Need an afternoon boost? Try water, a short walk, or some sunlight instead.

7
00:00:34,459 --> 00:00:37,594
What time is your last coffee? Tell me in the comments.

8
00:00:39,244 --> 00:00:42,005
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

